# With torii: one proxy qube checks and routes each connection.
direction: right

qube
sys-torii: "sys-torii\nchecks and routes\neach connection" {style.fill: "#fff4e0"; style.stroke: "#d9822b"}
internet
vpn: VPN
tailnet

qube -> sys-torii
sys-torii -> internet: only what you allow
sys-torii -> vpn: if you route it there
sys-torii <-> tailnet: in and out, port by port
